'''Santa''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is painted in red with a brown and yellow belt wrapped around the heel. The tip resembles Santa’s beard, which uses a white color. The guard is also white, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2669637780/Santa-Knife here].
*There was a bug where if players equipped the [[Knifeception]] effect with this knife, small images of [[Slime (Knife)]]’s decal would appear. However, this has since been patched.

